[PrintTextModified Text:那晚，<br>回到房间后，我照例开始写日记。|#0204Adv10_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]
@ResetText

; さらさらと紙にペンを走らせる書き音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_111 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1

[PrintTextModified Text:——监牢生活第二轮，第××天。|#0204Adv10_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——仍然找不到和大魔女有关的线索，<br>时间浑浑噩噩地流逝。|#0204Adv10_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——明明应该是由我来找到拯救她们的方法。<br>|#0204Adv10_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——留给我的时间已经不多了。|#0204Adv10_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（别焦躁。<br>　焦躁，只会把自己逼入绝境）|#0204Adv10_Hiro001|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了让心情平复下来，<br>我放下钢笔，深吸一口气。|#0204Adv10_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后，我看向了躺在床上的艾玛。|#0204Adv10_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆うなされている

[PrintTextModified Text:呜……呜呜……呃……|#0204Adv10_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她的呼吸浅而急速，<br>似乎正被噩梦折磨。|#0204Adv10_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听见艾玛发出痛苦的呻吟，<br>我便走到她身旁，轻轻摇醒了她。|#0204Adv10_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1.5 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，没事吧？要不要起来……|#0204Adv10_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:话音未落，我不经意触摸到艾玛肩头，<br>顿时一惊。|#0204Adv10_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（发高烧了……！）|#0204Adv10_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:7_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.99 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:我立刻把艾玛送往医务室，<br>并通知了大家。|#0204Adv10_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:少女们纷纷赶到了医务室。|#0204Adv10_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，你没事吧！<br>有什么想吃的？|#0204Adv10_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:嘘，吵闹是不好的！<br>她现在一定很难受。|#0204Adv10_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:她烧得很厉害，<br>到底是什么原因呢……真让人担心。|#0204Adv10_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia
@Wait WaitMode:0.1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:可能是太累了吧。<br>艾玛，现在不能勉强自己，要好好休息。<br>记得多喝水哦。|#0204Adv10_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria
@Wait WaitMode:0.1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:药在哪里……有没有药……！<br>可恶，要是冰上在的话，<br>就知道哪个是退烧药了……|#0204Adv10_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大家……对不起……|#0204Adv10_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……艾玛真是深受大家喜爱啊）|#0204Adv10_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:站着稍远处望着围在艾玛床边的少女们，<br>我再次强烈感受到这一点。|#0204Adv10_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:于是，<br>我们全心全意地照顾艾玛——|#0204Adv10_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 時間経過演出
@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
