@Wait WaitMode:0.9

; フクロウの通知音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_14 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:『各位，马上就到就寝时间了』|#0204Adv10_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『之后属于禁止外出时间，<br>　请迅速回到牢房内』|#0204Adv10_Narrative016|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不久后，我们的手机<br>收到了典狱长的通知。|#0204Adv10_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Alisa
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:啧，该回去了。|#0204Adv10_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然很担心艾玛的状况，<br>但也只能回去了……|#0204Adv10_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:如果身体状况不佳，<br>艾玛可以被允许留在医务室。|#0204Adv10_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有一人陪护也是允许的，<br>今晚就由我留下来陪护艾玛吧。|#0204Adv10_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:好，就拜托你了，希罗。|#0204Adv10_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:少女们陆续朝出口走去，<br>唯独汉娜仍留在艾玛床边。|#0204Adv10_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:……那个，艾玛。<br>这个是，我为你做的……|#0204Adv10_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ========================================
; アイテムスチル：『エマの人形』表示
; ========================================
@SpawnExtended Path:Clue Params:9-11

[PrintTextModified Text:希望能让你稍微打起精神来……<br>|#0204Adv10_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:哇，汉娜好厉害。<br>谢谢……！|#0204Adv10_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛虽然仍显得痛苦，<br>但她还是笑着接过汉娜递过来的人偶。|#0204Adv10_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@DestroySpawnedExtended Path:Clue LogWarning:true
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:汉娜依依不舍地，<br>离开了艾玛身旁。|#0204Adv10_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:……呼，总算安静下来了。|#0204Adv10_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我在艾玛身旁坐下。|#0204Adv10_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，给你添麻烦了，对不起……|#0204Adv10_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:别想太多。<br>现在专心把身体养好。|#0204Adv10_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，好……|#0204Adv10_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

; ここに遠ざかる足跡SEあってもいいかも

; ボイス加工：少しずつ遠くなる声

[PrintTextModified Text:那两个人，虽然一开始关系那么紧张，<br>但现在好像变得亲近多了，让人松了一口气。|#0204Adv10_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊是啊。<br>本来以为她们之间好像有什么过节，<br>不过现在看来终究还是朋友嘛。|#0204Adv10_Sherry003| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯，交给希罗肯定没问题的。|#0204Adv10_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:少女们的谈话声逐渐远去。<br>|#0204Adv10_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:（真是的，这么光明正大地议论我们……）|#0204Adv10_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我这么想着，看向艾玛，<br>却见她手里握着人偶，轻声笑着。|#0204Adv10_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可爱是可爱啦，但汉娜的品味有点独特呢。|#0204Adv10_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:确实。|#0204Adv10_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:但我真的很开心。<br>能收到汉娜做的这个人偶，<br>真的、真的，特别开心。|#0204Adv10_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的眼角涌起泪珠，<br>顺着脸颊缓缓滑落。|#0204Adv10_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她自己似乎也对这眼泪感到意外。|#0204Adv10_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆涙声

[PrintTextModified Text:咦……这是为什么……？<br>我一点也不想哭的啊……|#0204Adv10_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:你太累了。该睡了。|#0204Adv10_Hiro011| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:嗯……我好像，<br>总是被希罗帮助呢。<br>不管是以前，还是现在……|#0204Adv10_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看着艾玛露出苦笑，我的心一阵刺痛。|#0204Adv10_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（为什么要露出这样的表情？）|#0204Adv10_Hiro012| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（明明我曾经对你说过那么过分的话，<br>　甚至把你逼入绝境）|#0204Adv10_Hiro013|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（艾玛，你的真面目是……）|#0204Adv10_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:不久后，艾玛沉沉睡去。|#0204Adv10_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm FadeOutDuration:5

@ResetText


[PrintTextModified Text:然而，杀意却趁机涌上我的心头——|#0204Adv10_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我感到自己的魔女化进程正在加速。<br>这是理性即将崩溃的征兆。|#0204Adv10_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这杀意正在向我低语。<br>只要现在趁机掐死她，就能立刻摆脱万千心结。|#0204Adv10_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即使脑中还有一丝念头，知道不可为之，<br>但我却无法反抗杀意。|#0204Adv10_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:我的手伸向艾玛。<br>她安稳的呼吸拂过我的指尖。|#0204Adv10_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:耳边回响着自己剧烈的心跳声。|#0204Adv10_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

