[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛她呢，<br>终有一天会成为带来灾祸的魔女哦。|#0204Adv10_Yuki001| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她会杀死很多人。|#0204Adv10_Yuki002| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:会让大家变得不幸。|#0204Adv10_Yuki003| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:很可怕呢。<br>那一天终将到来。|#0204Adv10_Yuki004| AuthorId:Yuki RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……不记得是什么时候的事了。<br>小雪所说的话，有种神秘的说服力，<br>深深铭刻在我心里。|#0204Adv10_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:小雪因受霸凌而自尽的时候，<br>我痛恨艾玛，那时我的心被怨恨填满。|#0204Adv10_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛选择做个旁观者，<br>不去保护受霸凌的小雪，甚至对这一切视而不见。|#0204Adv10_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这件事以来，她依旧若无其事地与我相处，<br>而我却自认为看透了艾玛的本性。|#0204Adv10_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她就是带来灾厄的魔女。|#0204Adv10_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:害死了我最重要的朋友，<br>是决不能原谅的存在。|#0204Adv10_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

