[PrintTextModified Text:——我猛然睁开双眼。|#0204Adv10_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:回过神来，<br>我竟然在艾玛的床边睡着了。|#0204Adv10_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:抬头一看，艾玛仍在睡梦中，<br>正被梦魇折磨。|#0204Adv10_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆うなされている

[PrintTextModified Text:停手吧……小雪，<br>求求你，别再这样了……|#0204Adv10_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么是我……？<br>我明明不想、让大家死去……|#0204Adv10_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到这梦话的瞬间，<br>我不禁颤抖，下意识捂住了嘴。|#0204Adv10_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:几乎要失声尖叫。|#0204Adv10_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（或许，一直以来我都想错了）|#0204Adv10_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我们真正的敌人是……）|#0204Adv10_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我全身止不住战栗。|#0204Adv10_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

